        "body": "Erika Lane Frantzve Kirk is an American nonprofit executive, podcaster, and ministry founder. Her public work includes the Midweek Rise Up devotional podcast, PROCLAIM, and BIBLEin365. In September 2025, Turning Point USA appointed her CEO and Board Chair after the death of her husband, Charlie Kirk.",
